WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:03.672
(tambourine rattling)

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:07.022
♪ I made a man with eyes of coal ♪

00:00:07.022 --> 00:00:10.783
♪ And a smile so bewitchin' ♪

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:13.703
♪ How was I supposed to know ♪

00:00:13.703 --> 00:00:16.393
♪ That my mom was dead in the kitchen ♪

00:00:16.393 --> 00:00:20.263
(audience laughing and applauding)

00:00:20.263 --> 00:00:22.468
♪ (rattling tambourine) La, la,
la, la, la, la, la, la, la ♪

00:00:22.468 --> 00:00:24.040
- Partay!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.880
- That thing is not coming in here.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.880
- That thing?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.580
This is how you greet guests at a party?

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.413
Let me ask you something.

00:00:31.413 --> 00:00:32.910
If I showed up here
with my new girlfriend,

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.820
she wouldn't be welcome in your home?

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.810
- I'm thinking your new
girlfriend wouldn't urinate

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.475
on my coffee table.

00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:39.360
(audience laughing)

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.628
- He was more embarrassed
about that then anyone.

00:00:41.628 --> 00:00:43.114
(audience laughing)

00:00:43.114 --> 00:00:44.180
Okay?

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:47.670
And for him to have the
courage to walk back in here

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.277
like nothing happened.

00:00:50.277 --> 00:00:51.492
(audience laughing)

00:00:51.492 --> 00:00:53.010
- All right, all right.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.910
Just keep him away from me.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:55.743
- Thank you.

00:00:55.743 --> 00:00:56.576
Come on Marcel.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.488
What do you say you and
I do a little mingling?

00:00:59.488 --> 00:01:01.160
(audience laughing)

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.641
All right, I'll catch up with ya later.

00:01:04.641 --> 00:01:05.940
(audience laughing)

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.590
(monkey squeaking)
- Look at him.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.920
I'm not saying he needs to
spend the whole evening with me,

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.518
but at least check in.

00:01:11.518 --> 00:01:13.352
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.352 --> 00:01:15.263
- Rach, these are for you.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.182
- Wiper blades.

00:01:17.182 --> 00:01:18.610
(audience laughing)

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.062
I don't even have a car.

00:01:20.062 --> 00:01:22.830
- (laughs) I know, but
with this new car smell,

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.197
you'll think you do. (laughs)

00:01:24.197 --> 00:01:27.646
(audience laughing)

00:01:27.646 --> 00:01:29.070
- Okay, Phoebes, your turn.

00:01:30.898 --> 00:01:32.342
(audience laughing)

00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:33.620
- Ah!

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.848
Toilet seat covers!

00:01:34.848 --> 00:01:38.520
(audience laughing)

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.672
is that what you were doing
while I was getting gas?

00:01:40.672 --> 00:01:41.505
- Mm hm.
- Uh huh.

00:01:41.505 --> 00:01:42.603
- You guys.

00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:44.449
(audience laughing)

00:01:44.449 --> 00:01:46.933
- And for Ross, Mr. Sweet Tooth.

00:01:48.489 --> 00:01:51.150
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.290
- You got me a cola drink?

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.413
- And a lemon-lime!

00:01:55.413 --> 00:01:57.479
(audience laughing)

00:01:57.479 --> 00:02:00.330
- (laughs) Well this, this is too much.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.996
I feel like I should
get you another sweater.

00:02:02.996 --> 00:02:05.230
(audience laughing)

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:06.783
- And last buy not least.

00:02:09.642 --> 00:02:11.600
- They're ribbed for your pleasure.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.600
(audience laughing)

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.563
Phoebe, remember, hey,

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.880
they're just fulfilling their Christmas--

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:24.734
- Destiny.
- Sure.

00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:25.640
- Yeah.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.243
- All right.
- Okay.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.030
Yikes, that one doesn't
look very fulfilled.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.380
- Oh, that's a, that's
one of the old ones.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.410
He's just takin' it to the back.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.940
- You keep the old ones in the back?

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:39.406
That is so ageist.

00:02:39.406 --> 00:02:41.420
(audience laughing)

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.620
- Well, we have to make
room for the fresh ones.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.220
- So, what happens to the old guys?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.870
- Well, they go into the chipper.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.598
- Why do I have a feeling that's
not as happy as it sounds?

00:02:51.598 --> 00:02:52.632
(audience laughing)

00:02:52.632 --> 00:02:54.324
(chipper running)

00:02:54.324 --> 00:02:55.641
(dramatic music)

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:56.474
- No, No!

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.473
Oh!

00:03:01.243 --> 00:03:02.076
No!

00:03:03.535 --> 00:03:04.868
- Hey, hey, hey!

00:03:06.893 --> 00:03:09.226
(footsteps)

00:03:10.373 --> 00:03:12.133
(audience laughing)

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:14.929
- (gasps) Oh, my God!

00:03:14.929 --> 00:03:16.527
- [Both] Merry Christmas!

00:03:16.527 --> 00:03:17.360
- Ah, ha, ha!!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.105
(audience laughing)
Thank you!

00:03:19.105 --> 00:03:20.586
Yay!

00:03:20.586 --> 00:03:22.350
Oh, God, you're the best!

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.557
- It's like "Night of the
Living Dead" Christmas tree.

00:03:24.557 --> 00:03:25.498
(audience laughing)

00:03:25.498 --> 00:03:28.578
♪ Went to the store sat on Santa's lap ♪

00:03:28.578 --> 00:03:31.842
♪ Asked him to bring my
friends all kinds a crap ♪

00:03:31.842 --> 00:03:33.320
(audience laughing)

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.969
♪ Said, "All you need is
to write them a song" ♪

00:03:36.969 --> 00:03:40.570
♪ They haven't heard it yet
so don't try to sing along ♪

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.919
(audience laughing)

00:03:41.919 --> 00:03:43.066
♪ So, don't sing along ♪

00:03:43.066 --> 00:03:44.672
(audience laughing)

00:03:44.672 --> 00:03:49.339
♪ Monica, Monica, have a happy Hanukkah ♪

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.377
(audience laughing)

00:03:52.377 --> 00:03:54.938
♪ Saw Santa Clause ♪

00:03:54.938 --> 00:03:58.029
♪ He said, "Hello," to Ross ♪

00:03:58.029 --> 00:04:00.233
(audience laughing)

00:04:00.233 --> 00:04:02.895
♪ Please tell Joey ♪

00:04:02.895 --> 00:04:05.906
♪ Christmas will be snowing ♪

00:04:05.906 --> 00:04:07.663
(audience laughing)

00:04:07.663 --> 00:04:10.922
♪ And Rachel and Chandler ♪

00:04:10.922 --> 00:04:13.303
♪ How do (mumbles) under ♪

00:04:13.303 --> 00:04:15.830
(audience laughing)

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.169
Happy holidays everybody!

00:04:17.169 --> 00:04:18.332
(laughing and applauding)

00:04:18.332 --> 00:04:20.841
(ringing bell) Thank you, happy holiday.

00:04:20.841 --> 00:04:23.424
(ringing bell)

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:27.060
Now, that's trash, young lady.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.254
You can't, hey!

00:04:28.254 --> 00:04:29.606
Stop that young lady! (bell ringing)

00:04:29.606 --> 00:04:30.787
She donated trash!

00:04:30.787 --> 00:04:33.008
(audience laughing)

00:04:33.008 --> 00:04:33.841
Hey!

00:04:35.712 --> 00:04:37.708
The charity's on fire! (bell ringing)

00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:38.924
Help!

00:04:38.924 --> 00:04:40.028
Thank you, I need that!

00:04:40.028 --> 00:04:41.542
Woo!

00:04:41.542 --> 00:04:42.625
What is this?

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.922
It's nine o'clock in the morning!

00:04:44.922 --> 00:04:46.010
(audience laughing)

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.030
- Okay, it's no big deal.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.000
Important thing to remember, stay cool.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.833
- Got it!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.656
Oh my God, it's just like I dreamed it!

00:04:55.656 --> 00:04:56.910
(audience laughing)

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:00.367
Hey, I know what'll get
us up on a platform.

00:05:00.367 --> 00:05:02.030
- What?

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.250
- The routine!

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.570
When the snippy guy sees the routine,

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.202
he'll wanna build us our own platform.

00:05:07.202 --> 00:05:09.880
(audience laughing)

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:10.713
- Okay, let's do it.

00:05:10.713 --> 00:05:11.546
(audience laughing)

00:05:11.546 --> 00:05:13.522
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:14.681
(loud dance music)

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:17.681
(audience laughing)

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:49.293
(audience laughing and cheering)

00:05:55.484 --> 00:05:57.770
- So, do we really need to ask

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:00.220
who's going up on the platform next?

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.053
- Oh, no!

00:06:01.053 --> 00:06:03.821
You get up there and do that
again, exactly like that!

00:06:03.821 --> 00:06:04.654
- Yeah!
- Ah!

00:06:04.654 --> 00:06:07.743
(audience laughing)
- Make sure and get this.

00:06:07.743 --> 00:06:09.539
Dick will want it for the bloopers show.

00:06:09.539 --> 00:06:10.480
(audience laughing)

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.960
- I'm the holiday armadillo!

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.790
(audience laughing)

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.660
I'm a friend of Santa's,
and he sent me here

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:23.035
to wish you a merry Christmas!

00:06:23.035 --> 00:06:24.730
(audience laughing)

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:28.164
- What happened to
Santa, holiday armadillo?

00:06:28.164 --> 00:06:29.630
(audience laughing)

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:34.603
- Santa was unavailable
so close to Christmas!

00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:36.160
(audience laughing)

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.830
- Wow, come in, have a seat!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.477
You must be exhausted coming
all the way from Texas!

00:06:41.477 --> 00:06:44.963
(audience laughing)

00:06:44.963 --> 00:06:45.900
- Texas?

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.320
- That's right, Ben!

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:52.320
I'm Santa's representative
for all the Southern states!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.555
(audience laughing)

00:06:53.555 --> 00:06:55.811
And Mexico!

00:06:55.811 --> 00:06:58.160
(audience laughing)

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:03.160
But Santa sent me here to
give you these presents, Ben!

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.730
Maybe the lady will help
me with these presents!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.730
(audience laughing)

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.200
(thump)

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.880
(audience laughing)

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:15.297
(door shuts)

00:07:21.608 --> 00:07:24.790
- Are you for Hanukkah, too,
because I'm part Jewish?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.540
- (gasps) You are?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.373
Me, too!

00:07:28.665 --> 00:07:30.924
- Merry Christmas!

00:07:30.924 --> 00:07:31.757
(door shuts)

00:07:31.757 --> 00:07:32.960
(audience laughing)

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:37.838
What are you doing here weird, turtle man?

00:07:37.838 --> 00:07:40.643
(audience laughing)

00:07:40.643 --> 00:07:44.820
- I'm the holiday armadillo,
your part Jewish friend!

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:48.520
(audience laughing)

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:53.513
You sent me here to give
Ben some presents, remember?

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:56.882
- What?

00:07:56.882 --> 00:07:59.760
(audience laughing)

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.960
- Did you bring me any presents, Santa?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.940
- You bet I did, Ben!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:04.933
Put her there!

00:08:06.366 --> 00:08:07.440
(small thud)

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:10.887
(audience laughing)

00:08:10.887 --> 00:08:11.720
Wow!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.150
That is a good one.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.063
Wow, looks like a holiday card, you know,

00:08:15.063 --> 00:08:17.610
with that tree in the
middle, and the skaters,

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.110
and the snow. (laughs)

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.197
- You know, every year I say,

00:08:20.197 --> 00:08:22.140
"I'm gonna send out holiday
cards," and I never do it.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.603
Do you wanna, do you wanna
send this one out together?

00:08:26.117 --> 00:08:29.350
(audience laughing)

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:32.252
- Together, like to people?

00:08:32.252 --> 00:08:33.100
(audience laughing)

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.490
- Yeah, you know, happy
holidays from Mona and Ross.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.830
It'll be cute, okay?

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.759
- (laughs) Okay.

00:08:38.759 --> 00:08:40.610
(audience laughing)

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:45.400
I don't, I'm not sure
about the whole card thing.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.433
- Really, why not?

00:08:47.538 --> 00:08:50.913
- 'Cause it's sending out
a holiday card together.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:55.880
I just don't know if we're
really quite there yet.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.260
- So, can I ask you a question?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.093
- Yeah.

00:08:58.093 --> 00:08:59.030
- Where are we?

00:08:59.030 --> 00:08:59.923
- Huh?

00:08:59.923 --> 00:09:02.011
(audience laughing)

00:09:02.011 --> 00:09:03.630
- Well, like where are we?

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:05.603
Where is this relationship going?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.529
- Let's do the card!

00:09:08.529 --> 00:09:10.520
(audience laughing)

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.800
- What?
- The card!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:12.987
I think we're there.

00:09:12.987 --> 00:09:14.470
(audience laughing)

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:15.303
- Hi, honey!

00:09:15.303 --> 00:09:16.136
We're all here.

00:09:16.136 --> 00:09:17.510
We just want to wish
you a merry Christmas.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:18.960
- Aw, merry Christmas.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.320
I miss you guys.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.390
- Is it horrible?

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.040
Is everybody working really hard?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.123
- Ah, well no, it's just me and Wendy.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.593
- Ah, wait, is Wendy the
runner-up Miss Oklahoma?

00:09:29.593 --> 00:09:30.848
- What?

00:09:30.848 --> 00:09:32.620
(audience laughing)

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.813
- Well, she didn't win.

00:09:33.813 --> 00:09:36.150
(audience laughing)

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.610
- All right, well maybe I should let you

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:40.970
and the second prettiest girl
in Oklahoma get back to work.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.420
- Well, second prettiest that year.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.160
I mean, of all the girls in
Oklahoma, she's probably--

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.289
- No, Chandler, stop talking!

00:09:46.289 --> 00:09:49.601
(audience laughing)

00:09:49.601 --> 00:09:51.920
- (clicks phone down) The wife says, "Hi."

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.740
- Ah, fun conversation.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:58.265
- Ah, well, she's just got
this weird idea that, you know,

00:09:58.265 --> 00:10:01.030
just because you and I are
alone, something's gonna happen.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.392
- That be so terrible?

00:10:03.392 --> 00:10:05.460
(dramatic music)

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.002
- Woo hoo, back off missy!

00:10:07.002 --> 00:10:09.060
- (laughing) Missy?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:12.090
- I don't know, I'm not used
to girls making passes at me.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.112
Wait a minute, am I sexy in Oklahoma?

00:10:15.112 --> 00:10:16.300
(audience laughing)

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.133
I'm married!

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:18.760
- So, I'm married!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.003
- Unhappily married.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:23.630
- Okay, let me ask you something.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.483
If what you and your
wife have is so great,

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.953
then why are you spending
Christmas with me?

00:10:32.823 --> 00:10:33.740
- You think it's snowing in Tulsa

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.794
where my husband's have
sex on a copying machine?

00:10:35.794 --> 00:10:38.794
(audience laughing)

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:40.940
- Hey!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.530
- What are you doing here?

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:43.830
- I wanted to be with you.

00:10:45.206 --> 00:10:46.990
I missed you so much.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.340
- Hey, hey, uh, who'd you miss the most?

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.173
- Monica.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.736
- Gotcha.

00:10:52.736 --> 00:10:55.736
(audience laughing)

